review_comments.body:
The critical section should be on the outer loop, not just on a single call according to the [PyDict_Next() documentation](https://docs.python.org/dev/c-api/dict.html#c.PyDict_Next):

```c
      Py_BEGIN_CRITICAL_SECTION(self->dict);
      while (PyDict_Next(self->dict, &pos, &key, &value)) {
          ...
      }
      Py_END_CRITICAL_SECTION();
```

